  "faqDeleteAccountQ": "How do I delete my account?",
  "faqDeleteAccountA": "Go to Settings → Account → Delete Account. Confirm the dialog to permanently delete your Mevora account and associated data. This cannot be undone.",
  "faqChangePhotoQ": "How do I change my profile photo?",
  "faqChangePhotoA": "Open Settings → Edit Profile. You can add, remove, or replace photos from your gallery or camera. Photos may be reviewed before they appear to others.",
  "faqCloseAccountQ": "How do I close my account?",
  "faqCloseAccountA": "Closing your account is the same as deleting it. Use Settings → Account → Delete Account. Logging out alone does not delete your data.",
  "faqHowMatchQ": "How does matching work?",
  "faqHowMatchA": "Mevora picks people who may be right for you. When you and someone like each other, you match and can chat from the Matches tab.",
  "faqMatchPercentQ": "What does the match percentage mean?",
  "faqMatchPercentA": "It's an estimate of how well you might fit, based on your answers, interests, lifestyle, music taste and other signals. It helps explain why Mevora picked someone for you — it's never a guarantee.",
  "faqCantMessageQ": "Why can't I send a message?",
  "faqCantMessageA": "Messaging is only available in active mutual matches. You cannot message if the match ended, you blocked each other, or the conversation was closed.",
  "faqNotificationsQ": "How do I manage notifications?",
  "faqNotificationsA": "Open Settings → Notifications to control match, message, and other alerts. You may also need to allow notifications in your device settings.",
  "faqBlockQ": "How do I block someone?",
  "faqBlockA": "From a chat, tap More → Block. From a profile, open the safety menu → Block. Blocked users cannot message you or appear in your matches.",
  "faqReportQ": "How do I report someone?",
  "faqReportA": "From a chat or profile safety menu, choose Report, select a reason, and optionally add details. Reports are reviewed by our team.",
  "faqStaySafeQ": "How can I stay safe on Mevora?",
  "faqStaySafeA": "Meet in public places, keep personal details private until you trust someone, use block and report tools, and review our Community Guidelines.",
  "guidelinesIntro": "Mevora is built for respectful connections. These rules apply to profiles, messages, calls, and all in-app behavior.",
  "guidelinesRespectTitle": "Respectful communication",
  "guidelinesRespectBody": "Treat others with respect. Disagreement is not an excuse for insults, bullying, or degrading language.",
  "guidelinesHarassmentTitle": "No harassment or bullying",
  "guidelinesHarassmentBody": "Repeated unwanted contact, intimidation, stalking, or pressuring someone is not allowed.",
  "guidelinesHateTitle": "No hate speech",
  "guidelinesHateBody": "Content attacking people based on protected characteristics is prohibited.",
  "guidelinesThreatsTitle": "No threats or violence",
  "guidelinesThreatsBody": "Threats, glorification of violence, or encouragement of self-harm are forbidden.",
  "guidelinesSpamTitle": "No spam",
  "guidelinesSpamBody": "Unsolicited promotions, repetitive messages, or automated solicitation are not allowed.",
  "guidelinesFakeTitle": "No fake accounts",
  "guidelinesFakeBody": "Impersonation, misleading identity, or profiles that are not authentically you are prohibited.",
  "guidelinesScamTitle": "No fraud",
  "guidelinesScamBody": "Scams, financial fraud, phishing, or asking for money or sensitive financial data are forbidden.",
  "guidelinesInappropriateTitle": "No inappropriate content",
  "guidelinesInappropriateBody": "Offensive, graphic, or otherwise unsuitable content is not allowed in profiles or messages.",
  "guidelinesSexualTitle": "Sexual content and exploitation",
  "guidelinesSexualBody": "Non-consensual sexual content, exploitation, or sexual content involving minors is strictly prohibited and will be reported to authorities.",
  "guidelinesMinorsTitle": "Protecting minors",
  "guidelinesMinorsBody": "Mevora is for adults 18+. Profiles or behavior targeting minors are banned.",
  "guidelinesPrivacyTitle": "Protect personal information",
  "guidelinesPrivacyBody": "Do not share another person's private contact details, address, documents, or passwords without consent.",
  "guidelinesMisuseTitle": "No platform misuse",
  "guidelinesMisuseBody": "Do not attempt to bypass safety systems, scrape data, or use Mevora for unauthorized commercial activity.",
  "guidelinesReportTitle": "How to report",
  "guidelinesReportBody": "Use Report from a profile or chat. Choose the closest reason and add context. You can also contact support from Settings.",
  "guidelinesEnforcementTitle": "Enforcement",
  "guidelinesEnforcementBody": "Violations may result in warnings, feature limits, suspension, or permanent removal. Serious violations may be reported to law enforcement.",
  "termsIntro": "These Terms of Service govern your use of the Mevora mobile application and related services.",
  "termsScopeTitle": "Scope of service",
  "termsScopeBody": "Mevora helps adults discover compatible people, match through mutual likes, chat, and use optional features such as Boost and profile verification.",
  "termsAccountTitle": "Your account",
  "termsAccountBody": "You must be at least 18 years old. You are responsible for keeping your login credentials secure and for activity on your account.",
  "termsResponsibilitiesTitle": "Your responsibilities",
  "termsResponsibilitiesBody": "You agree to provide accurate information, follow applicable laws, and use Mevora respectfully and safely.",
  "termsContentTitle": "Profile and content",
  "termsContentBody": "You own the content you submit, but grant Mevora a license to host, display, and process it to operate the service, including moderation and safety review.",
  "termsProhibitedTitle": "Prohibited behavior",
  "termsProhibitedBody": "Harassment, hate speech, scams, fake profiles, sexual exploitation, spam, and attempts to harm other users or the platform are prohibited.",
  "termsMatchingTitle": "Matching and messaging",
  "termsMatchingBody": "Matches are created through mutual likes. Messaging is available only in active matches and may be limited by safety, blocking, or moderation actions.",
  "termsSafetyTitle": "Safety tools",
  "termsSafetyBody": "You can block and report users. We may review reports and take action to protect the community.",
  "termsSuspensionTitle": "Suspension or termination",
  "termsSuspensionBody": "We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms or create risk for other users.",
  "termsDeletionTitle": "Account deletion",
  "termsDeletionBody": "You may delete your account in Settings → Account → Delete Account. Deletion is permanent and removes your profile and associated app data subject to legal retention limits.",
  "termsPaidTitle": "Paid features",
  "termsPaidBody": "Boost and other purchases are processed through your app store. Refunds follow the store's policies unless required otherwise by law.",
  "termsThirdPartyTitle": "Third-party services",
  "termsThirdPartyBody": "Mevora may integrate with services such as Google Sign-In, Apple Sign-In, Spotify, Firebase, and identity verification providers. Their terms also apply.",
  "termsAvailabilityTitle": "Service availability",
  "termsAvailabilityBody": "We strive for reliable service but do not guarantee uninterrupted availability. Features may change or be discontinued.",
  "termsLiabilityTitle": "Limitation of liability",
  "termsLiabilityBody": "To the extent permitted by law, Mevora is provided as is. We are not liable for user conduct or offline interactions between users.",
  "termsChangesTitle": "Changes",
  "termsChangesBody": "We may update these Terms. Material changes will be communicated in the app or on our policy pages.",
  "termsContactTitle": "Contact",
  "termsContactBody": "For legal questions, contact support from Settings or email halilmertdeveliii@gmail.com.",
  "termsEffectiveTitle": "Effective date",
  "termsEffectiveBody": "These Terms are effective as of August 23, 2026.",
  "privacyIntroTitle": "Introduction",
  "privacyIntroBody": "This Privacy Policy explains how Mevora collects, uses, stores, and deletes personal data when you use our app.",
  "privacyDataCollectedTitle": "Overview",
  "privacyDataCollectedBody": "We collect only data needed to operate matching, messaging, safety, optional music features, and account management.",
  "privacyAuthTitle": "Account and authentication data",
  "privacyAuthBody": "Depending on how you sign in, we may process email, phone number, authentication provider identifiers (Google, Apple, Spotify), and Firebase Authentication user ID.",
  "privacyProfileTitle": "Profile data and photos",
  "privacyProfileBody": "Profile details you provide (name, bio, preferences, relationship answers, photos) are stored in Firebase Firestore and Firebase Storage to display your profile and power matching.",
  "privacyLocationTitle": "Location data",
  "privacyLocationBody": "With your permission, we use approximate location to show nearby compatible people. Precise coordinates are not exposed to other users in discovery results.",
  "privacyMessagingTitle": "Messages and calls",
  "privacyMessagingBody": "Chat messages, voice notes, images, typing indicators, and call metadata are stored to deliver the service. Messages may be end-to-end encrypted when both users have published encryption keys.",
  "privacyMatchingTitle": "Matching and interactions",
  "privacyMatchingBody": "Likes, passes, matches, compatibility signals, and interaction history are stored to operate discovery and matches.",
  "privacyPreferencesTitle": "Settings and preferences",
  "privacyPreferencesBody": "Notification preferences, privacy controls (online status, last seen, typing), discovery filters, and language settings are stored to honor your choices.",
  "privacySpotifyTitle": "Spotify data",
  "privacySpotifyBody": "If you connect Spotify, we store linked account metadata and music taste signals used for compatibility and music features. You can disconnect Spotify in settings.",
  "privacyDeviceTitle": "Device and technical data",
  "privacyDeviceBody": "We process device tokens for push notifications, app diagnostics, and security logs through Firebase and related infrastructure.",
  "privacyWhyTitle": "Why we use data",
  "privacyWhyBody": "To authenticate you, show matches, deliver messages, improve safety, provide support, process optional purchases, and comply with law.",
  "privacyStorageTitle": "Where data is stored",
  "privacyStorageBody": "Data is primarily stored in Google Firebase (Firestore, Storage, Authentication, Cloud Functions) in the EU region where configured.",
  "privacyRetentionTitle": "Retention",
  "privacyRetentionBody": "We keep data while your account is active. When you delete your account, we delete or anonymize associated data except where law or fraud prevention requires limited retention.",
  "privacySharingTitle": "Sharing",
  "privacySharingBody": "We do not sell personal data. We share data with service providers (Firebase, app stores, Spotify, verification vendors) only as needed to operate Mevora.",
  "privacyRightsTitle": "Your rights",
  "privacyRightsBody": "Depending on your region, you may request access, correction, deletion, or restriction of your data. Account deletion is available in Settings.",
  "privacyDeletionTitle": "Deleting your data",
  "privacyDeletionBody": "Use Settings → Account → Delete Account for permanent deletion. Support tickets you created are also removed as part of account deletion.",
  "privacySecurityTitle": "Security",
  "privacySecurityBody": "We use access controls, encryption in transit, optional message encryption, and Firebase security rules. No system is perfectly secure; report issues to support.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "Children",
  "privacyChildrenBody": "Mevora is not for users under 18. We delete accounts identified as underage.",
  "privacyChangesTitle": "Policy changes",
  "privacyChangesBody": "We may update this policy. The latest version is always available in the app and on our public policy page.",
  "privacyContactTitle": "Contact",
  "privacyContactBody": "Privacy questions: halilmertdeveliii@gmail.com or create a support request in Settings.",
